  "hypothesis": {
    "claim": "On exact canonical opening 1000000 bytes, preserve v14 P/E-A/E-B/decode identity and package accounting while treating EACCES as nonfatal terminal telemetry only when both stat snapshots prove the same terminal PID/start identity and a prior successful IO sample of that exact identity exists.",
