  "changedMechanism": "Execution-only correction for the exact retained v14 failure: after a prior successful sample, unchanged PID/start with both stat states Z/X/x and IO errno EACCES is recorded as previously_sampled_terminal_io_unavailable; no counter is fabricated and all other error paths remain fatal.",
