    "Before importing v13 or the new telemetry helper, the successor coordinator locally verifies hardcoded exact path, byte count, and SHA-256 records for every inherited v13/v12/v11/v10/v3/v2/stage/lease/verifier/guard/objective dependency and its new stage/helper.",
    "The unchanged reused v13 guard, before importing its v12 base, locally verifies hardcoded exact path, byte count, and SHA-256 records for the inherited v12/v11/v10 guard chain.",
    "The successor coordinator, stage and telemetry helper plus reused v13 guard are prospectively hash-bound by this experiment and candidate program/revision; no entrypoint uses a circular self-hash.",
    "The direct executable artifact set must exactly equal the stdlib-only Python runtime closure index.",
    "Preflight schema is gamma.enwiki9.cmix-obias-opening1m-preflight.zombiefix-q0-v1.",
    "CPU affinity and temporary disk are diagnostic abort-after-observation only; elapsed is diagnostic only.",
    "Memory, runtime, CPU, temporary-disk, and PPM-trigger eligibility are N_A and never PASS.",
    "larger_gate_authorized is false and next_gate_bytes is null.",
    "separately_frozen_100m_experiment_required is true; v14 authorizes no larger gate.",
    "Validation-only mode performs no corpus, cgroup, lease acquisition, HORIZON, Geekbench, or job execution.",
    "The v13 exact inner failure branch is unknown because the execution report was lost; its comparator payload and archive exactly match baseline and receive no treatment/roundtrip credit.",
