    "Each encode and decode writes execution.json before inspecting returncode or measurement_complete; partial observation errors are retained.",
    "Each arm adds exactly one execution.json to the complete output manifest; these diagnostic evidence bytes earn zero codec score credit.",
    "The terminal affinity exemption requires successful guard return, complete affinity/process evidence, correct nonempty peak codec samples, and a genuinely empty terminal process/CPU set.",
    "The user-authorized independent concurrent opening-1M scheduling persists; no active HORIZON artifacts, ownership or process controls are accessed.",
